// Alien Weapon Pack: six Hazudra and Zica weapons, three front, three rear,
// eleven power levels each like the original weapons (front[] / rear[], MODDING.md 5.3).
//
// Shop icons: 24x28, built from parts of the original shop housings by
// utils/alien_weapon_icons.py, recoloured per faction (game palette, near-black
// rim, two-step drop shadow of the original icons; docs/mod-art-pipeline.md 12).
// Shots: 12x14, four frames each, drawn by utils/mod_shot_draw.py (white-hot
// core, saturated body, dark rim). The frames <name>_1..4 get consecutive sprite
// slots (PNGs are numbered in name order), so "animation": 3 cycles all four.
//
// Balance (README, utils/mod_weapon_balance.py): damage per second = salvo damage
// x 35 / (fire_delay + 1), compared at every level with the original weapons of
// the same price. POSITIVE speed_y = upward; sub_delay 255 = the shot lives until
// it leaves the screen (MODDING.md 5.4). The source of this file is generated:
// keep the level tables and the README table in step (docs/mod-art-pipeline.md).
